      "thought": "I need to join expense with budget (via link_to_budget) and budget with event (via link_to_event) to find the event with the lowest cost. Let me write a direct SQL query.",
      "action": "execute_context_sql",
      "action_input": {
        "path": "/tmp/data_agent_structured_t0am8aqv.sqlite",
        "sql": "SELECT e.event_name, MIN(CAST(ex.cost AS REAL)) as min_cost FROM expense ex JOIN budget b ON ex.link_to_budget = b.budget_id JOIN event e ON b.link_to_event = e.event_id GROUP BY e.event_id ORDER BY min_cost ASC LIMIT 1",
        "limit": 200
